  "decision_rationale": [
    "All frames actually referenced by the three site shells/interiors remain pixel-identical at A1 current coordinates; the old A8 texture pin is internally compatible for those consumers.",
    "The new land-to-land shore masks may improve ellipse/path transitions: ash↔gravel/moor and gravel/soil for Quarry/Mill; forest↔soil/moor and gravel↔soil for Orchard. No current A8 renderer composes neighbor-aware edge masks, so changing only atlas bytes/coords would not make these visible.",
    "Adopting shore masks safely requires a neighbor-aware edge compositor plus native-size visual review; that is outside this local surface task. Do not perform a blind atlas repin or claim visual acceptance.",
    "The two notes-crate prop frames do not serve the three site identities and would imply unrelated research-note rewards; do not add them."
  ],
